# Curtis Hardin Research Lab Website

This repository contains the source code for Professor Curtis Hardin's Academic Research Laboratory website.

## Overview
The website showcases research projects, publications, team members, and teaching materials for the lab.


## Project Structure
- `index.html` - Homepage
- `about.html` - About the lab & Curtis Hardin
- `people.html` - Lab members & team
- `research.html` - Current research projects
- `publications.html` - Published papers and work
- `teaching.html` - Course and teaching materials
- `contact.html` - Contact information
- `style.css` - Custom styling
